WEBVTT

00:02:29.954 --> 00:02:35.746
And he he hung up on me and I called him
back and he said, Shut up, Adam,

00:02:35.871 --> 00:02:37.871
I won't talk to you until
you admit you're wrong.

00:02:39.621 --> 00:02:43.246
And that was sort of a it really it
was a moment that stuck with me.

00:02:43.996 --> 00:02:45.538
I didn't have the language
for it at the time,

00:02:45.538 --> 00:02:48.163
but I spent a lot of time
afterward thinking,

00:02:48.454 --> 00:02:50.413
why is it so important to me to be right?

00:02:51.038 --> 00:02:54.996
And, you know, why do I have such a
hard time admitting when I'm not?

00:02:55.538 --> 00:02:58.038
And that, you know, I think I was
I was sort of a defining moment.

